  "details": "hello ive been having issues when recording in vr, ever since the recent update why does some avatars jitter when they are dancing? its really frustrating. tried checking on servers and changing it on different instance, its getting better but not really solve the problem. definetly not my OBS because i checked that twice. the thing is one of my dancers are from EU region and when we change it to EU region the jitter is less obvious. BUT ITS STILL THERE. it wasnt like this before the unity 6 trial update because i think i heard you guys are slowly transitioning to unity 6. now there has been more than 10 encounters to this problem and somehow it all happened in different ways. for an example, avatar A was okay with the tracking on day one. and then on day 2 avatar A is having the jitter on recording. does that make sense? does Server choice matters to this problem?",
